From 77c3c3f84f203c2ed839b1a3e2de5025738bd1be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kirn Gill II <segin2005@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 11:07:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/98] etc/hosts: map the hostname to 127.0.0.1, not the
 127.0.1.1 alias

CDE's ToolTalk messaging system (ttsession) is reached by Sun-RPC at the
local hostname (gethostname()).  substrate's loopback only fully
round-trips 127.0.0.1: a datagram to another 127/8 address such as the
Debian-style 127.0.1.1 alias is dropped on input (ip4_input accepts only
the loopback device's configured 127.0.0.1), and even past that the
reply's source address doesn't match what the connected RPC client sent
to.  So with the default hostname "agar" mapped to 127.0.1.1, tt_open()
failed -- dtsession put up "The desktop messaging system could not be
started" and the desktop came up bare with the startup hourglass, while
plain WMs (matwm2/twm/ctwm), which use no RPC, worked fine.

Put the hostname on the 127.0.0.1 line and drop the 127.0.1.1 entry so
ToolTalk's RPC stays on the address substrate's loopback fully handles.
Together with the sys_recvmsg/sys_sendmsg msg_name fix, CDE's ToolTalk
now starts and dtwm decorates the session.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 etc/hosts | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/etc/hosts b/etc/hosts
index a0445d36..013db15d 100644
--- a/etc/hosts
+++ b/etc/hosts
@@ -1,6 +1,12 @@
 # /etc/hosts — substrate static host table
-127.0.0.1       localhost localhost.localdomain
+#
+# The machine's own hostname is mapped to 127.0.0.1 (not the Debian-style
+# 127.0.1.1 alias).  CDE's ToolTalk messaging system rpc-pings ttsession at
+# the local hostname, and substrate's loopback only fully round-trips
+# 127.0.0.1 — a hostname pointing at any other 127/8 address makes tt_open()
+# fail ("The desktop messaging system could not be started") and the desktop
+# never comes up.  Keep the hostname on 127.0.0.1.
+127.0.0.1       localhost localhost.localdomain agar agar.localdomain
 ::1             localhost localhost.localdomain ip6-localhost ip6-loopback
 ff02::1         ip6-allnodes
 ff02::2         ip6-allrouters
-127.0.1.1       agar agar.localdomain
-- 
2.54.0

